<section class="folio-hero shell">
  <div class="folio-topline"><span class="eyebrow">Independent security researcher</span><span class="eyebrow">Tangerang, Indonesia / <%= Time.now.year %></span></div>
  <div class="folio-stage">
    <img class="folio-bloom" src="<%= base('/assets/images/editorial/magnolia-pencil.webp') %>" width="1024" height="1536" alt="A magnolia branch drawn in graphite and colored pencil, with ivory flowers and sage leaves.">
    <div class="folio-title"><h1>Jody<br><em>Ritonga.</em></h1><p class="folio-caption">A curious mind. A closer look.</p></div>
    <span class="folio-annotation" aria-hidden="true">Magnolia / a study in attention</span>
  </div>
  <div class="folio-intro"><p>I look for the small assumptions<br>that become <em>real vulnerabilities.</em></p><div><p>Browser and Android security research, guided by curiosity and grounded in reproducible evidence.</p><a class="text-link" href="#selected-work">Explore my work <span aria-hidden="true">↓</span></a></div></div>
</section>
<section class="folio-record-band"><div class="shell folio-records"><span><strong><%= format('%02d', @discoveries.length) %></strong> public CVE disclosures</span><span class="eyebrow">Disclosures across</span><div><span>Apple</span><span>Microsoft</span><span>Mozilla</span></div></div></section>
<section class="section work-section shell" id="selected-work">
  <div class="section-heading"><div><span class="section-number">01 / Selected research</span><h2>Small details.<br><em>Lasting impact.</em></h2></div><div class="folio-heading-note"><p>Permission boundaries, browser interfaces, and the trust we place in software.</p><a class="text-link" href="<%= base('/discoveries/') %>">All public work <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></div></div>
  <div class="folio-work-layout"><figure class="folio-work-art"><img src="<%= base('/assets/images/editorial/research-study.webp') %>" class="generated-study" width="1536" height="1024" alt="A curious bird and magnifying glass studying a browser window among magnolias." loading="lazy"><figcaption>01 / Looking closer</figcaption></figure><div class="work-list"><% @discoveries.first(3).each_with_index do |discovery, index| %><%= discovery_row(discovery, index: index + 1) %><% end %></div></div>
  <p class="section-footnote">Responsibly disclosed. Linked to public CVE and vendor records.</p>
</section>
<% if @writeups.any? %>
<% latest = @writeups.first %>
<section class="section folio-writing"><div class="shell">
  <div class="section-heading"><div><span class="section-number">02 / Field notes</span><h2>Behind the <em>finding.</em></h2></div><a class="text-link" href="<%= base('/blog/') %>">All writing <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></div>
  <a class="home-blog-feature" href="<%= base("/blog/#{latest['slug']}/") %>"><figure><img src="<%= base(latest['cover']) %>" alt="<%= h(latest['cover_alt']) %>" width="<%= latest['cover_width'] %>" height="<%= latest['cover_height'] %>" loading="lazy"></figure><div><div class="card-meta"><span><%= h(latest['label']) %></span><span><%= latest['reading_time'] %> min read</span></div><h3><%= h(latest['title']) %></h3><p><%= h(latest['excerpt']) %></p><span class="blog-card-link">Read the story <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></span></div></a>
</div></section>
<% end %>
<section class="section shell folio-process">
  <div class="section-heading"><div><span class="section-number">02 / The practice</span><h2>Curiosity meets<br><em>conviction.</em></h2></div><div class="folio-heading-note"><p>I use LLMs to explore possibilities, then test those ideas against the code. The evidence gets the final word.</p><a class="text-link" href="<%= base('/method/') %>">My process <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></div></div>
  <div class="practice-layout"><figure class="process-study"><img class="generated-study" src="<%= base('/assets/images/editorial/process-study.webp') %>" width="1536" height="1024" alt="A ribbon travels through paper doorways above an open research notebook." loading="lazy"><figcaption>02 / Following the thread</figcaption></figure>
  <ol class="folio-process-list">
    <li><span class="section-number">I / Observe</span><h3>Follow the boundaries.</h3><p>Trace how applications handle trust, and where an assumption starts to break.</p></li>
    <li><span class="section-number">II / Verify</span><h3>Make the proof clear.</h3><p>Build focused tools and reproducible tests that show what an attacker can actually do.</p></li>
    <li><span class="section-number">III / Disclose</span><h3>Help the fix happen.</h3><p>Share precise evidence, explain the impact, and work through responsible disclosure.</p></li>
  </ol></div>
</section>
<figure class="research-garden shell"><img src="<%= base('/assets/images/editorial/research-garden.png') %>" width="1536" height="1024" alt="A hand-drawn research garden: magnolias growing through a laptop, a magnifying glass, an open notebook, and a cup of coffee." loading="lazy"><figcaption><span class="section-number">From the notebook</span><span>A few things that keep me curious.</span></figcaption></figure>
<section class="folio-personal shell"><figure><img src="<%= base('/assets/images/editorial/about-study.webp') %>" class="generated-study" width="1536" height="1024" alt="A little black bird perched on books beside coffee and magnolias." loading="lazy"></figure><div><span class="section-number">Away from the screen</span><h2>Always a little<br><em>curious.</em></h2><p>About software. About the details most people pass by. And, yes, about magnolias.</p><a class="text-link" href="<%= base('/about/') %>">A little about me <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></div></section>
<section class="contact-band"><div class="shell folio-contact"><div><span class="section-number">Good work starts with a conversation</span><h2>Something worth<br><em>looking into?</em></h2></div><div><img src="<%= base('/assets/images/editorial/flying-letter.svg') %>" width="400" height="320" alt="A winged letter." loading="lazy"><p>Security research, source review, or something useful we could build together.</p><a class="text-link" href="mailto:jodyritonga@gmail.com">jodyritonga@gmail.com <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></div></div></section>
